use firn/tags

glow is a Module
glow is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.glow.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.glow]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."glow"."enable": enable "glow — terminal markdown renderer (tables, pager, dir browser)"
